<title>BELGIUM: ADVISORY - Synergia RIC is SYNB.BR.</title>
<headline>ADVISORY - Synergia RIC is SYNB.BR.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reuter Instrument Code (RIC) for Synergia NV, the Belgian holding company that begins trade today on the Brussels segment of the Euro.NM market, is SYNB.BR.</p>
<p>645,000 Synergia shares were sold at 650 Belgian francs each in an initial public offering that closed on Friday. Around 33 percent were sold to retail investors.</p>
<p>The company has applied to the Brussels Stock Exchange to have a total of 720,000 shares listed.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
